Task & $n$ & $\Delta_\text{full}$ & D\%\textsubscript{int} & D\%\textsubscript{det} & D / I / N \\
\midrule
id-life-stages-1       & 20  & $+47.50$ & 55   & 10   & 9 / 0 / 11  \\
lifespan-long          & 25  & $+44.00$ & 56   & 16   & 11 / 1 / 13 \\
